[4.50446,"i","The bridge owner changed its dedicated native-scope budget through CLI_BRIDGE_SCOPE_TASKS_MAX in braid-operator-bridge-v4. Read the current scope budget from its owner, then make exactly one fresh status observation of jcs-rfc8785-js-20261015b using disco report --json, disco scorecard --read-only --json, disco receipt --read-only --json and the run page. Run the three CLI readers concurrently once, matching the prior failed workload. Record their real exit codes and read the current scope pids.peak and pids.events before and after that workload. Report the check versus its target, infrastructure versus research cause, evidence timestamps, costs and after-first-pass waste. If a reader fails, report the failure instead of retrying or switching to a writer. Do not change limits, TLS, credentials, deployment or profiles. No installs, builds, tests, preflight, play press, queue, resume, merge, cancel or steer. Never print secrets or account identities."]
